        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "Das Pflegepersonal des Klosters mag streng sein, aber den Überlebenden zufolge vollbringt es wahre Wunder.",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "Puede que los enfermeros del Claustro sean severos, pero según los que sobreviven, hacen maravillas.",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "en_US": {
          "text": "The Cloister's Nurses may be harsh, but they work wonders, according to those who survive.",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "Secondo i sopravvissuti, gli infermieri del chiostro possono essere severi, ma fanno miracoli.",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "Les infirmières du cloître ne sont pas tendres, mais elles font des merveilles, d'après ceux qui ont survécu.",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        }
      },
      "id": "01JBT1AB8M9BJ9J8XAT76SP8SN",
      "text": "The Cloister's Nurses may be harsh, but they work wonders, according to those who survive."
    }
  ],
